  "_note": "Body + hands mapping for transferring an already-animated Mixamo skeleton onto an ARP rig (source = mixamorig:Hips/Spine/Spine1/Spine2/.../LeftToeBase, target = ARP c_*). Derived from arp.json (BlendCap BVH source) with the Mixamo-source substitutions used in mixamo_to_mixamo_ctrl.json: source_prefix='mixamorig:' for namespace handling, use_world_location for IK source position lookups, custom_ik_sources block for any later manual IK bake. SPINE remap: Mixamo has 3 spine bones (Spine/Spine1/Spine2) plus Hips where BlendCap BVH has 4 (Spine/Spine1/Spine2/Spine3) — Mixamo Hips drives the bottom spine target (c_root.x) that BlendCap Spine drove, and the rest shift down one slot. LOCOMOTION: Mixamo has no Root bone, so Hips alone drives c_pos (LOC XY) and c_root_master.x (LOC Z) in addition to c_root.x (ROT). NO FACE: Mixamo capture never carries face data, so all face pairs are omitted.",
